                                "sense_id": "21e8d9cf-ed44-3a55-9e98-44b1bce8f367",
                                "text": "Does anyone know how Powerpoint deals with .PCS files?\nPOPULAR.PCS contains the default clipart supplied when you install PPT I presume."
