                                "text": "With the advent of Acrobat Reader 6, Adobe takes into account alot^([sic]) of new features that can be exported along with the PowerPoint files in the transition to PDF. […] Using Reader 6 allows the newer PPTs made by people using the latest PowerPoint software to export easily and include all the features included in said PPTs."
